WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:03.378
<i>Brazilian democracy and I
are almost the same age.</i>

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:06.798
<i>I thought that in our thirties,</i>

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.218 position:66%
<i>we would both be standing on solid ground.</i>

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.304
<i>Petra,</i>

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.141
<i>the first time voting
in a historical election.</i>

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:19.227
<i>I was 19 when Lula got elected.</i>

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.938
<i>I remember the excitement...</i>

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:23.815
Lula!

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.612
<i>It felt like a huge step
in our democratic path.</i>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.283 position:59%
<i>Twenty million people leaving poverty,</i>

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.744 position:59%
<i>unemployment reached the lowest number
in history,</i>

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:39.414
<i>and Brazil rises as a major player
on the world stage.</i>

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:42.208 position:66%
He's the most popular politician on Earth.

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:46.713 position:66%
<i>To succeed him, he chooses Dilma Rousseff,</i>

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.965 position:61%
<i>who becomes our first female president.</i>

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:52.635
We will all be judged by history.

00:00:57.807 --> 00:00:59.434
<i>It felt like a change of symbols.</i>

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.026
<i>But something in our social fabric
started to change.</i>

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:09.027
Circle in!

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.029
<i>The country divided into two parts.</i>

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:13.156
<i>And this wall...</i>

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.783
Lock Lula up!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.284
This is absurd!

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.952
<i>...would rip us apart.</i>

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:22.373
<i>The party is soon caught
in a corruption scandal,</i>

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:25.210
<i>the greatest investigation
in the country's history.</i>

00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:28.004
What will they think of us?

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:31.883 position:66%
My biggest regret is not having done more.

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:35.845
Crimes include fraud, slavery,

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.639
<i>even homicide...</i>

00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:43.561
<i>One president impeached,
another in prison...</i>

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:45.563
<i>Our democracy was crumbling.</i>

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:47.273
This sexist hoax!

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:51.986
<i>I get stronger each day
towards public opinion.</i>

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:03.456 position:56%
<i>I fear our democracy
was nothing but a short-lived dream.</i>

